'''Kalkor Point''' is a neutral centaur camp located on the northern point of [[Gillijim's Isle]]. It was established by a band of centaur mercenaries, the [[Kalkor]], who had been hired by the [[Southsea Freebooters]]. However, the Kalkor were betrayed by their leader, [[Lykourgos]], and left his kin stranded on the island.

